  "description": "The 8bar MITTE Ti V2 transforms from a fast road bike to a gnarly gravel bike in minutes. Thanks to our custom flip chips, you only need a second wheelset to switch between setups. Of course, you can also ride it purely as gravel bike.\n\nBuilt from titanium, the frame combines strength, low weight, corrosion resistance and a uniquely smooth ride quality.\n\nOne bike that adapts to your ride. From long road miles to rough gravel adventures.\n\nFLIP-CHIP DROPOUTS\n\nOur custom flip-chip dropouts let you fine-tune the bike’s geometry in seconds. By flipping the inserts, you can adjust wheel position and handling characteristics to match your riding style, terrain, or setup.\n\nCLEAN DESIGN & AERODYNAMICS\n\nFully internal cable routing for electronic and mechanical groupsets creates a clean, uncluttered look while reducing aerodynamic drag. Embossed logos on the head tube and dropout highlight the frame’s distinctive design. The result is a sleek frame with improved aerodynamics for smooth and efficient riding at high speeds.\n\nMORE ESSENTIALS\n\nAn extra mounting point on the downtube gives you more flexibility on longer rides. Use it for an additional bottle cage or to carry a repair kit when you need to be prepared for anything on the road.\n\nUDH READY\n\nIt is SRAM UDH-ready, making it fully prepared for modern drivetrain systems. This ensures better compatibility, easier service, and long-term future-proofing.",
